<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><meta charSet="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_next/static/css/cd98198ac679e956.css" data-precedence="next"/><link rel="preload" as="script" fetchPriority="low" href="/_next/static/chunks/webpack-74c939c87fa0092a.js"/><script src="/_next/static/chunks/4bd1b696-c023c6e3521b1417.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/493-e61740f684b4ba13.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/main-app-76bd8c52cbf0e045.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/app/layout-ac3572f154940993.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/app/free/%5Bslug%5D/page-b3a84ded65bb5fea.js" async=""></script><link rel="preload" href="https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtag/js?id=G-5E3GHN8G3X" as="script"/><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"/><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin="anonymous"/><title>The STORM Research Stack | Hyperautomation Labs</title><meta name="description" content="Subscribe to Hyperautomation AI Report and get the The STORM Research Stack free."/><link rel="canonical" href="https://hyperautomationlabs.co/free/storm"/><meta property="og:title" content="The STORM Research Stack | Hyperautomation Labs"/><meta property="og:description" content="Subscribe to Hyperautomation AI Report and get the The STORM Research Stack free."/><meta property="og:url" content="https://hyperautomationlabs.co/free/storm"/><meta property="og:type" content="website"/><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary"/><meta name="twitter:title" content="The STORM Research Stack | Hyperautomation Labs"/><meta name="twitter:description" content="Subscribe to Hyperautomation AI Report and get the The STORM Research Stack free."/><link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico"/><link rel="icon" href="/favicon-192.png" sizes="192x192" type="image/png"/><link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/apple-touch-icon.png"/><link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800;900&amp;family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@500;700&amp;display=swap" rel="stylesheet"/><script src="/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-42372ed130431b0a.js" noModule=""></script></head><body><div hidden=""><!--$--><!--/$--></div><main class="lead-magnet-page"><section class="lead-magnet-hero"><div class="lead-magnet-shell"><div class="lead-magnet-card"><div class="lead-magnet-eyebrow">5 copy-paste prompts that rebuild Stanford&#x27;s STORM research method inside Claude</div><h1>Get the STORM Research Stack Prompt Pack</h1><p class="lead-magnet-description">Stanford&#x27;s OVAL lab built STORM — a research method that writes Wikipedia-grade, fully-cited articles from scratch by discovering many perspectives, interviewing an expert from each, and grounding every answer in a real source. This field guide turns that whole pipeline into 5 copy-paste prompts you can run today inside Claude: (1) Perspective Discovery (map the 6-8 expert lenses a topic deserves), (2) Simulated Expert Interview (a multi-turn Q&amp;A per perspective where every claim is cited or marked &#x27;unverified&#x27;), (3) Curate &amp; Outline (group, dedupe, flag contradictions, build a source-mapped outline), (4) Grounded Writing (section by section, every claim cited, no invented facts), and (5) the Moderator Pass from Co-STORM (surface the unknown unknowns and red-team for source bias and red herrings, then fix them). Each prompt comes with when to use it, what good output looks like, and a full worked example. Method credit: Stanford OVAL — STORM, NAACL 2024.</p><div class="lead-magnet-offer"><span>Subscribe to Hyperautomation AI Report</span><span>Get the PDF free</span><span>Keyword: <!-- -->STORM</span></div><form class="lead-magnet-form"><input type="email" placeholder="Enter your email" required="" value=""/><button type="submit">Subscribe + Send PDF</button></form><p class="lead-magnet-consent">By submitting, you&#x27;ll be subscribed to the <strong>Hyperautomation AI Report</strong> <!-- -->newsletter — one practical AI email per week. Unsubscribe anytime.</p><p class="lead-magnet-privacy">Free. No spam. Unsubscribe anytime.</p></div></div></section></main><!--$--><!--/$--><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@graph":[{"@type":"Organization","@id":"https://hyperautomationlabs.co/#organization","name":"Hyperautomation Labs","url":"https://hyperautomationlabs.co","description":"AI education platform delivering practical tips, tools, tutorials, and GEO optimization services.","sameAs":["https://youtube.com/@hyperautomationlabs1045","https://www.instagram.com/hyperautomationlabs/","https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=61583775315320"]},{"@type":"WebSite","@id":"https://hyperautomationlabs.co/#website","url":"https://hyperautomationlabs.co","name":"Hyperautomation Labs","publisher":{"@id":"https://hyperautomationlabs.co/#organization"}}]}</script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/webpack-74c939c87fa0092a.js" id="_R_" async=""></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"1:\"$Sreact.fragment\"\n2:I[1402,[\"177\",\"static/chunks/app/layout-ac3572f154940993.js\"],\"\"]\n3:I[9766,[],\"\"]\n4:I[8924,[],\"\"]\n6:I[4431,[],\"OutletBoundary\"]\n8:I[5278,[],\"AsyncMetadataOutlet\"]\na:I[4431,[],\"ViewportBoundary\"]\nc:I[4431,[],\"MetadataBoundary\"]\nd:\"$Sreact.suspense\"\nf:I[7150,[],\"\"]\n:HL[\"/_next/static/css/cd98198ac679e956.css\",\"style\"]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"0:{\"P\":null,\"b\":\"KuOQzQp-KVdiUTN-cLXfl\",\"p\":\"\",\"c\":[\"\",\"free\",\"storm\"],\"i\":false,\"f\":[[[\"\",{\"children\":[\"free\",{\"children\":[[\"slug\",\"storm\",\"d\"],{\"children\":[\"__PAGE__\",{}]}]}]},\"$undefined\",\"$undefined\",true],[\"\",[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"link\",\"0\",{\"rel\":\"stylesheet\",\"href\":\"/_next/static/css/cd98198ac679e956.css\",\"precedence\":\"n